**318.** Draw full lines using the following construction pairs.
a: k=0.5,3,-2, all l=-2 and all y-intercepts (0,-2);
second points (2,-1),(2,4),(2,-6), respectively.
b: k=-4,3,0, all l=1 and all y-intercepts (0,1);
second points (1,-3),(1,4),(1,1), respectively.
The k=0 member is the horizontal line y=1, still linear.

**327.** Downstream speed 14+2=16 km/h. Duration 2 hours 15 minutes=9/4 h;
distance 16*(9/4)=36 km. Upstream speed 14-2=12 km/h;
return duration 36/12=3 hours.
